        <attacktype>LogicalTypeRangedUnitsAttack</attacktype><autoattacktype>LogicalTypeRangedUnitsAutoAttack</autoattacktype><attackresponsetype>LogicalTypeHandUnitsAttack</attackresponsetype><attackmovetype>AbstractWall</attackmovetype>
